{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where information is valued above all else, your mission is to obtain data capable of changing the course of scientific progress and shaping the future. Using the unique ability to remotely control a miniature cockroach, you will gain access to restricted areas, bypass security systems, and face unexpected obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Gameplay:</strong>\u00a0control the cockroach and feel not like a superhero, but like a tiny, vulnerable insect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth and Strategy:</strong> your diminutive size grants advantages and imposes limitations \u2014 use it wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Storyline:</strong> immerse yourself in the narrative \u2014 there will be no easy choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and Secrets:</strong> some puzzles will be, to say the least, very challenging; you\u2019ll need to deploy all your resources to solve them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assistant:</strong> with our intelligent assistant, you will never be alone, even if you desperately want to be.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to embark on a mission where your eyes, ears, and little legs belong to a tiny spy?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Let's go!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3516940/b6807fa7f2f43132858c6e38b14a708aa44e6e5c.jpg"},{"name":"Giant Slayer.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3516940/82f1f2845b4005ef507afc6fcd8ac33e2fb72e0c.jpg"},{"name":"Rat Maze.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3516940/ba29c4831082aa0e1f7a8461b533db3411b97127.jpg"},{"name":"What a disgusting thing to do!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.